{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A creepy tunnel inhabited by a gigantic creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped inside this tunnel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The objective of the game is to escape the tunnel by avoiding traps and the giant creature that blocks your progress, while searching for the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a short horror game that surrounds the player with a sense of unease and tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How to play</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's search for the tunnel's exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475730/extras/image00.gif?t=1744799820\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475730/extras/image01.gif?t=1744799820\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are detected and consumed by the giant creature or get caught in a trap, your progress will be reset, and you will be forcibly returned to the starting point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475730/extras/image03.gif?t=1744799820\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475730?t=1744799820","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744799820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475730/38cfe6eec0ebe5800876c35c1f3e85f14fbe81d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744799820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475730/38cfe6eec0ebe5800876c35c1f3e85f14fbe81d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744799820","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"